cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DMI-tool or the accompanying analysis code, please cite this software and the associated manuscript."
title: "DMI-tool: Dietary Matching Index calculator and reproducible analysis code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pan
    given-names: Yuzhe
repository-code: "https://github.com/yuzhepan/DMI-tool"
url: "https://github.com/yuzhepan/DMI-tool"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-09-07
abstract: >-
  DMI-tool provides a browser-based Dietary Matching Index calculator and R
  code for constructing eight pattern-specific indices, propagating dietary
  uncertainty, evaluating spatial structure, and modelling country-level
  associations with healthy life expectancy.
